        "tab_liquid_LDr3jc": {
          "type": "tab_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "title": "CARE INSTRUCTIONS",
            "custom_liquid": "{%- if product.type == 'Jewelry' -%}\n<p><style=\"text-align: center; color:#000000;\"><strong>Jewelry Care Instructions</strong></p>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>Keep jewelry away from water, moisture, and humidity. Avoid wearing it while swimming, bathing, or engaging in any water-related activities.\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>Store jewelry in a cool, dry place, preferably in a jewelry box or airtight container. This will prevent exposure to air, moisture, and dust, which can cause tarnishing and damage.\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>Avoid contact with perfumes, lotions, hairsprays, and other chemicals. These substances can react with the metal or stones in the jewelry and cause discoloration or deterioration.\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>Clean jewelry regularly using a soft cloth or a mild jewelry cleaner specifically designed for jewelry. Gently wipe the surface to remove any dirt, oils, or residue.\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>Handle the jewelry with care and avoid excessive pulling or tugging, as it can lead to the breakage of chains, clasps, or components.\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>When not in use, store different pieces of jewelry separately to prevent scratching or tangling.\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>If any stones become loose or fall out, get them repaired or replaced promptly to maintain the overall appearance and integrity of the jewelry.\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>Periodically inspect your jewelry for any signs of damage or wear. If you notice any issues, take it to a professional jeweler for repair.\n</li>\n</ul>\n{%-endif-%}\n{%- if product.type == 'Saree' or product.type == 'Blouse'-%}\n<p><style=\"text-align: center; color:#000000;\"><strong>Saree / Blouse Care Instructions</strong></p>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>Void washing silk sarees or blouses by hand or in a washing machine.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>If the saree/blouse becomes stained, promptly blot the stain with cold water.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>Never dry silk/silk cotton sarees or blouses directly under sunlight as it can cause the color to fade.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>Avoid bundling up the saree/blouse to prevent the zari/embroidery threads from tangling.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>Store the saree/blouse in a breathable cotton muslin cloth, allowing air circulation and preventing sticking when stacked.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\n    <li>Do not store the saree/blouse in a plastic cover to avoid blackening of the gold zari.</li>\n</ul>\n{%-endif-%}\n{%- if product.type == 'Bag'-%}\n<p><style=\"text-align: center; color:#000000;\"><strong>Hand Bags Care Instructions</strong></p>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>Handle the handbag with clean hands to avoid transferring dirt, oils, or other substances onto the fabric or surface.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>Protect the handbag from excessive moisture or water. Avoid using it in rainy conditions or placing it directly on wet surfaces.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>If the handbag gets stained, gently blot the stain with a clean cloth or sponge using mild soap and water. Avoid rubbing the stain vigorously, as it can damage the fabric or finish.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>Avoid exposing the handbag to direct sunlight for prolonged periods, as it can cause fading or discoloration. When not in use, store the handbag in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>Be cautious when handling sharp objects or rough surfaces to prevent scratches or tears on the handbag material.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>Avoid overstuffing the handbag, as it can distort the shape and strain the seams or handles. Instead, maintain a reasonable load to preserve the handbag&#39;s structural integrity.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n    <li>Regularly clean the handbag&#39;s interior by emptying it and removing any debris or dust. Use a soft brush or a lint roller to gently clean the lining.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n    <li>Store the handbag in a dust bag or a breathable cloth cover to protect it from dust, dirt, and potential scratches when not in use.</li>\n</ul>\n{%-endif-%}"
          }
        },
        "tab_html_wRtYPQ": {
          "type": "tab_html",
          "settings": {
            "title": "SHIPPING & RETURN",
            "content": "<p><strong>DELIVERY</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Saree without Blouse Stitching</strong>: Dispatch within 2-3 business days </li><li><strong>Saree with Blouse Stitching</strong>:  Dispatch within 10-12 business days. </li><li><strong>Suites & Dresses</strong>: Dispatch within 14-21 business days. </li></ul><p><em><strong>Free shipping across all products on a minimum purchase of $75 USD. </strong></em></p><p>International delivery time 5-7 business days after dispatch.</p><p><strong>RETURNS</strong></p><p>IndyVogue prides itself in making sure that the product shipped to its patrons are of the highest quality & standard. We would do everything to make sure we help you in choosing the right product. </p><p>If a customer wishes to return it, they will have to bear the cost of shipping the product back to IndyVogue locations in USA / India along with 5% restock fee. </p><p>In the rare occasion, if you need to return an item, please send us an email to sumanab@indyvogue.com within 48 hours of the shipment being delivered with picture of any issue that you see in the item for return authorization. The patron will need to ship the item in its original packaging and will have to pay for the return shipping charge to our Fulfillment Center in Austin, TX OR Kolkata, India, whichever is convenient to the patron. But we are sure that situation will never arise.The items need to be returned within 7 days of the shipment being received else return requests will be cancelled. Please look at our Delivery & Returns section for further information.</p><p><strong>Any custom made items like </strong><em><strong>Saree with Stitched Designer Blouse</strong></em><strong> OR </strong><em><strong>Suites & Dresses</strong></em><strong> cannot be returned.</strong></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_html_7dKb7L": {
          "type": "tab_html",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Custom tab",
            "content": "",
            "page": "wash-care"
          }
        },
        "tab_html_qgY3Kz": {
          "type": "tab_html",
          "settings": {
            "title": "COLOR DISCLAIMER",
            "content": "<p>We take utmost care when taking pictures of our products. But sometimes shades displayed across the different kind of fabrics and accessories may slightly vary from the actual color. This most likely could happen due to different settings in your monitor or viewing device like Laptop, Mobile OR Tablet. Also photos seen in different brands of same device like in an IPhone vs Samsung Galaxy might look different. We request you to consider these minor color variations.Video have been added to provide you a glimpse of the texture and work of the Saree. The color shown in the picture is a more accurate representation of the product.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_liquid_ipfAzd": {
          "type": "tab_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "title": "FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS",
            "custom_liquid": "{%- if product.type == 'Saree' -%}\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>\n        <strong>I want to get a saree and also add a Stitched Designer Blouse. How can I send you the measurements?</strong>\n        <p>\n            <strong>A:&nbsp;</strong>Once you select the <em>Stitched Designer Blouse</em> from the <em>Complete Your Look</em> section and place your order, you will receive an order confirmation email containing the link to our <em>Blouse Measurement Form</em>. Please submit your measurements there.\n        </p>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>\n        <strong>Can I send my own blouse design?</strong>\n        <p>\n            <strong>A:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. While we have a variety of ready neck designs, you can also share your own blouse design after placing the order, and our tailoring team will stitch it accordingly.\n        </p>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>\n        <strong>I have some blouse pieces with me. Can I just stitch the blouse with IndyVogue?</strong>\n        <p>\n            <strong>A:&nbsp;</strong>We only stitch blouses if you are purchasing a saree from us. Independent blouse stitching without buying a saree is not available.\n        </p>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>\n        <strong>What is the Minute Drape – Pre-Stitched Saree Add-on?</strong>\n        <p>\n            <strong>A:&nbsp;</strong>It is a convenient pre-stitched option available under <em>Complete Your Look</em>. When selected, our team will pre-stitch your saree so you can drape it in less than a minute. Please allow an extra 4–5 business days for stitching after you place the order.\n        </p>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>\n        <strong>Do you provide a Matching Petticoat?</strong>\n        <p>\n            <strong>A:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. You can add a <em>Matching Petticoat</em> from the <em>Complete Your Look</em> section when buying your saree.\n        </p>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>\n        <strong>Where do you ship your items from?</strong>\n        <p><strong>A:&nbsp;</strong>Most orders are shipped directly from Kolkata, India via DHL Express Priority. Some select products may also ship from our U.S. office.</p>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>\n        <strong>How long will it take for me to receive the saree I just ordered?</strong>\n        <p>\n            <strong>A:&nbsp;</strong>For sarees without add-ons, we ship within 1–2 business days and delivery takes 4–5 business days.  \n            If you added <em>Stitched Designer Blouse</em> or <em>Minute Drape</em>, please allow an additional 4–5 business days for stitching before shipping.\n        </p>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>\n        <strong>Do you offer free shipping?</strong>\n        <p><strong>A:&nbsp;</strong>Yes, IndyVogue offers free worldwide shipping on all sarees.</p>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>\n        <strong>I do not want to make online payment. Is there another way to pay?</strong>\n        <p><strong>A:&nbsp;</strong>Yes, you can pay via Venmo, Zelle, Wise, or even send a paper check. Please call us at +1 913-579-2118, email <a href=\"mailto:sumanab@indyvogue.com\">sumanab@indyvogue.com</a>, or chat with us online to arrange alternative payment.</p>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>\n        <strong>How do I know the status of my order?</strong>\n        <p>\n            <strong>A:&nbsp;</strong>You will be updated at every stage:  \n            – <em>Order Confirmation Email</em> when your order is placed  \n            – <em>Shipment Confirmation Email</em> when it ships  \n            – <em>Text message</em> when it is Out for Delivery  \n            – <em>Delivery Confirmation Email</em> and <em>text message</em> when delivered\n        </p>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>\n        <strong>Are all your sarees authentic and Silk Mark Certified?</strong>\n        <p><strong>A:&nbsp;</strong>All our pure silk sarees are clearly marked Silk Mark Certified, guaranteeing authenticity. The Sarees that are not pure Silk does not carry the Silk Mark Certified logo.</p>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>\n        <strong>What if I don’t like the saree after receiving it?</strong>\n        <p><strong>A:&nbsp;</strong>We accept returns or exchanges within 3 days of delivery. Please note that custom stitched blouses, pre-stitched sarees, and matching petticoats are non-returnable.</p>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-bottom: auto;\">\n    <li>\n        <strong>Do you accept international orders?</strong>\n        <p><strong>A:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. IndyVogue ships worldwide with free shipping on all sarees.</p>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n{%- endif -%}"
          }
        }
      },
